    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robbing Time</strong> is an online coop horror heist game, where you and up to 4 of your friends will face mighty Superheroes standing between you and treasures in various locations. Use your connections in the corrupted prison to buy gadgets, upgrades and choose your mission. It's Robbing Time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/e596f5eae3fdce1d707f7370dddd0b2c.poster.avif?t=1753879893\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/e596f5eae3fdce1d707f7370dddd0b2c.webm?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/e596f5eae3fdce1d707f7370dddd0b2c.mp4?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gadgets:</strong> You only have 3 item slots. Choose what you carry wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heist:</strong>\u00a0Each location has a unique heist to pull off. Figure it out while the Superhero is on your tail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communicate:</strong>\u00a0Use the proximity voice chat to coordinate with your team or use unique solo player advantages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/28ffe1a1b4c7337b044c75f5c00ce59a.poster.avif?t=1753879893\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/28ffe1a1b4c7337b044c75f5c00ce59a.webm?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/28ffe1a1b4c7337b044c75f5c00ce59a.mp4?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROBBERS VS SUPERHEROES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may defeat cops and security guards, but the only thing you can do against a Superhero is to hide or run!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Superdog:</strong>\u00a0The savior of Crime City. Watch for his laserbeam!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightstalker:</strong> Her cat moves allow her to travel through the vents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disappearing Man:</strong>\u00a0Not many have actually seen this man...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/3e5c68be2c4ddf87383ac8b5a47c31b9.poster.avif?t=1753879893\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/3e5c68be2c4ddf87383ac8b5a47c31b9.webm?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/3e5c68be2c4ddf87383ac8b5a47c31b9.mp4?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robbing Time</strong> is an online coop horror heist game, where you and up to 4 of your friends will face mighty Superheroes standing between you and treasures in various locations. Use your connections in the corrupted prison to buy gadgets, upgrades and choose your mission. It's Robbing Time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/e596f5eae3fdce1d707f7370dddd0b2c.poster.avif?t=1753879893\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/e596f5eae3fdce1d707f7370dddd0b2c.webm?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/e596f5eae3fdce1d707f7370dddd0b2c.mp4?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gadgets:</strong> You only have 3 item slots. Choose what you carry wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heist:</strong>\u00a0Each location has a unique heist to pull off. Figure it out while the Superhero is on your tail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communicate:</strong>\u00a0Use the proximity voice chat to coordinate with your team or use unique solo player advantages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/28ffe1a1b4c7337b044c75f5c00ce59a.poster.avif?t=1753879893\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/28ffe1a1b4c7337b044c75f5c00ce59a.webm?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/28ffe1a1b4c7337b044c75f5c00ce59a.mp4?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROBBERS VS SUPERHEROES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may defeat cops and security guards, but the only thing you can do against a Superhero is to hide or run!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Superdog:</strong>\u00a0The savior of Crime City. Watch for his laserbeam!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightstalker:</strong> Her cat moves allow her to travel through the vents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disappearing Man:</strong>\u00a0Not many have actually seen this man...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/3e5c68be2c4ddf87383ac8b5a47c31b9.poster.avif?t=1753879893\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/3e5c68be2c4ddf87383ac8b5a47c31b9.webm?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/3e5c68be2c4ddf87383ac8b5a47c31b9.mp4?t=1753879893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
